{
  "id": "048",
  "title": "My Better Ending",
  "subtitle": "\"I was reincarnated as the villainess. She was badly written. I decided to write her better.\"",
  "penName": "Rhea Sands",
  "genre": "villainessIsekai",
  "hook": "I died at thirty-four reviewing otome games for a gaming magazine. I woke up as Seraphine Malloran, a villainess from a game I had given two stars for \"incoherent character motivation.\" I had spent my whole adult life arguing that bad female characters were badly written, not innately evil. Now I was one. I had seventy-six days before the Autumn Gala when, in canon, I threw poison into the punch bowl for reasons the writer had not bothered to establish. I had news for the writer. I was rewriting the whole arc.",
  "coverPath": "covers/048.jpg",
